<title>USA: Norwood Q4 oper before charge $0.20/shr.</title>
<headline>Norwood Q4 oper before charge $0.20/shr.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended  Year to Date</p>
<p>					 Aug	Aug	Aug	Aug</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Sales			  $ 43,474 $ 31,633 $151,962 $103,860</p>
<p> Cash Flow (A) (B)	     3,253    2,466   11,811    8,057</p>
<p> Net income (B)		  1,167    1,358    5,138    4,032</p>
<p> Net income per share (B)     0.20     0.37     1.01     1.10</p>
<p> Cash flow per share (A) (B)  0.56     0.67     2.32     2.20</p>
<p>(A) Net income plus depreciation and amortization.  </p>
<p>(B) Excludes non-recurring charges of $1.6 million before taxes and $983,000 after taxes. Including the charge, fiscal 1996 earnings were $4.15 million or $0.82 per share, and fourth quarter earnings were $185,000 or $0.03 per share. (a) Cash flow is defined as Net Income plus depreciation and amortization.</p>
</text>
